[ti:Ma suɣeɣ]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Lbabuṛ]
[length:8:34]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:14.26] Ḍḥiɣ-d ɛzizeɣ i lmeḥna
[00:19.45] Uɣaleɣ-as d aqcic n ccuq
[00:28.48] Tewwet armi ass mi d i-tufa
[00:32.95] Tewwet armi tezla faruq
[00:40.81] Ul-iw teẓẓa-t s tlufa
[00:45.57] Deg-s ass-a tzad lɣella
[00:50.47] Armi t-izdeɣ ssaḥuq
[00:54.72]
[00:57.95] Ma suyeɣ ulac wi ara d-yeslen
[01:02.24] Siwa lemḥayen
[01:04.62] Ssazzalent iɣef-iw
[01:09.81] D nutenti i d iyi-issnen
[01:13.65] Ulac wi niḍen
[01:16.01] Cbant tamɛict-iw
[01:21.35] Wi ibɣan iɛdawen
[01:24.90] Yessuget aggawen
[01:28.65] Nekk friɣ yid-wen
[01:31.88] Fell-awen ad tebɛed tenṭelt-iw
[01:35.70]
[01:52.06] Deg uzekḍuf ma ṛǧiɣ leslak
[01:55.57] Ad iyi-izad lehlak
[01:57.65] Lehna ur d-teṭṭilli
[02:03.43] Qqaren wi ittnadin ɣef snat
[02:07.20] Kullec ad as-ifat
[02:09.15] Di nndama ad d-yeggri
[02:14.72] Qqaren-d idrimen
[02:18.72] Wi i ten-isɛan dayen
[02:22.50] Umasriɣ-asen
[02:25.55] Nnif-iw ma d ay yeɣli
[02:30.10]
[02:44.89] Affug ur as-nezmir ara
[02:49.27] Tcekkel ṣṣuṛa
[02:51.25] Yeṭṭef-aɣ bu-berrak
[02:56.99] Fell-aneɣ tiṭ tṛeṣṣa
[03:00.88] Acu ay d tirrugza
[03:02.77] Ma tḍeggɛeḍ gma-k
[03:08.49] Acu ay d ssɛaya
[03:12.29] D nnif d lḥerma
[03:15.82] Ma terniḍ lehna
[03:19.14] Ur d-ittaẓ ḥedd ɣer ttrika-k
[03:24.66]
[03:39.02] I Lezzayer yettwalasen
[03:42.97] Anwa tt-iṛehnen
[03:45.08] A widak yeẓṛan
[03:50.81] I umdan akken illuẓen
[03:54.44] Anwa ara t-isseččen
[03:56.66] Ma d winna yeɛran
[04:02.41] Mačči wi idergen
[04:06.03] Ɣef yiɣemɣumen
[04:10.06] Si tmura n medden
[04:12.90] Ad d-ismendag deg wayen irɣan
[04:17.88] Ad d-ismendag deg wayen irɣan
[04:22.00] Win i as-innan yeshel ubrid
[04:25.17] Ad yezwir nekkni ad t-neḍfer
[04:28.02] Win i as-innan awwaḍ qrib
[04:30.78] Xas ad d-yas ad aɣ-isseḥḍer
[04:33.57] Ters tmeɣra n ttjarib
[04:35.43] Win yeččuren lǧib
[04:37.03] Yettnadi ad isafer
[04:40.10] Amkan yeṭṭef-it win ur neɛtib
[04:41.88] Wiṭraman ad t-istixxer
[04:44.54] Ah a tawaɣit
[04:47.46] Nugi ad d-neffeɣ si yir targit
[04:51.29]
[05:02.02] Ṛuḥent tmegraḍ n yirgazen
[05:04.83] Ṛuḥent am wakken d leqmar
[05:07.45] I immaren ay idammen
[05:10.23] Adrar si tuǧǧal yeɛmer
[05:12.98] Adrim ɣer wid irewlen
[05:14.88] Ass-a smendagen
[05:16.50] Mi i ten-irra akkin lebḥer
[05:19.44] Ma dagi neḥwaǧ-iten
[05:21.06] Si tmura n medden ulayɣer
[05:23.94] Ah a tawaɣit
[05:27.00] Nugi ad d-neffeɣ si yir targit
[05:31.05]
[05:41.25] A widak yettḑebbiren
[05:44.11] Amek akka ara tḑebbrem fell-i
