[05:49.47] Nettnaɣ fell-awen ur neẓṛi
[05:52.06] Mačči di lisaɛ ara thedren
[05:54.04] Xemmlẹt i yiyallen
[05:55.77] Zwiret-aɣ ad ken-nwali
[05:58.72] Gar-aneɣ ara d-tbanem
[06:00.35] Ma d izmawen neɣ d ulli
